WEBVTT

00:25.500 --> 00:27.390
Your Highness, are you
over the moon right now?

00:28.320 --> 00:29.230
I want to hold it back,

00:29.710 --> 00:30.600
but I just can't.

00:30.992 --> 00:32.032
You said I am the best,

00:32.048 --> 00:33.584
and that you would marry no one but me.

00:34.600 --> 00:35.350
Your Highness,

00:36.320 --> 00:37.880
didn't we agree long ago

00:38.200 --> 00:40.200
that this marriage
is mutually beneficial?

00:41.280 --> 00:44.030
Don't tell me
you mistakenly thought what I said

00:44.030 --> 00:45.200
was genuinely from my heart?

00:49.390 --> 00:50.920
Why can't you just humor me a bit?

00:51.168 --> 00:52.200
I am very easy to please.

02:17.060 --> 02:17.792
=Blossoms of Power=

02:17.792 --> 02:20.660
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:20.740 --> 02:23.700
=Episode 13=

02:35.216 --> 02:37.520
Your Highness, you personally
escorted me back to my manor.

02:37.680 --> 02:39.520
Four hours
have already passed since then.

02:40.190 --> 02:41.310
When are you leaving?

02:42.470 --> 02:43.630
Four hours already?

02:44.750 --> 02:46.080
Time flies so fast.

03:01.560 --> 03:02.960
What are we having for dinner?

03:03.960 --> 03:07.240
When did I ever invite you
to have dinner with me, Your Highness?

03:09.024 --> 03:10.430
It's just the way to treat a guest.

03:10.512 --> 03:12.000
I thought you would understand that.

03:14.310 --> 03:16.710
Do you even have
the awareness of being a guest?

03:19.000 --> 03:21.710
So you also feel that I am more like
the master of the house?

03:23.728 --> 03:25.120
You'd better just stay hungry.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.630
Since you don't want to see me,

03:39.630 --> 03:40.430
I'll just leave.

03:40.624 --> 03:42.048
I'll come to see you another day.

03:44.736 --> 03:45.600
No need to see me out.

03:59.750 --> 04:01.310
Why does it feel like

04:01.800 --> 04:04.080
Crown Prince is
acting a bit strange today?

04:11.470 --> 04:12.430
Where is my handkerchief?

04:14.400 --> 04:15.680
Wasn't it just right here?

04:21.430 --> 04:22.950
A Crown Prince

04:23.568 --> 04:25.480
actually turned into
a thief for a handkerchief?

04:26.750 --> 04:28.190
Who would believe this if it got out?

04:29.120 --> 04:29.920
Would you believe it?

04:42.720 --> 04:43.360
Your Highness,

04:44.032 --> 04:46.400
ever since you came back from
Commandery Princess's place,

04:46.430 --> 04:48.390
you've been in
a constant state of excitement.

04:49.070 --> 04:51.120
Your eyes are as bright
as the morning star.

04:51.280 --> 04:53.104
I don't even dare to
look at you directly.

04:55.160 --> 04:55.870
Tian Yuan,

04:57.070 --> 04:57.920
I...

04:58.830 --> 05:00.190
discovered a secret of Xihe's.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.070
Look.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.360
Immortal Vine

05:07.600 --> 05:09.190
is embroidered on this handkerchief?

05:09.270 --> 05:10.430
It really is the Immortal Vine.

05:12.680 --> 05:13.560
Tell me,

05:14.032 --> 05:16.672
Commandery Princess embroidered
the Immortal Vine on her handkerchief.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.680
What does this mean?

05:18.720 --> 05:19.870
I don't know the answer.

05:24.310 --> 05:27.310
Although she seems cold on the surface,

05:27.560 --> 05:29.680
she actually values
old bonds very much in her heart.

05:30.390 --> 05:32.950
This Immortal Vine once
helped her out of a tight spot,

05:33.120 --> 05:34.270
so she never forgot it.

05:34.950 --> 05:36.750
If she treats a mere herb like this,

05:37.040 --> 05:39.630
then what about a person
who stays by her side every day

05:39.920 --> 05:41.560
and shares both joys
and sorrows with her?

05:47.160 --> 05:48.600
Commandery Princess's thoughts

05:48.640 --> 05:50.464
are very hard for
ordinary people to guess.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.430
Moreover,

05:51.950 --> 05:53.510
many people trust objects

05:53.568 --> 05:55.024
more than they trust human hearts.

05:56.830 --> 05:58.640
Wait. Commandery Princess doesn't know

05:58.672 --> 06:00.970
that you were the one
who gave her the Immortal Vine.

06:01.024 --> 06:03.040
So, why would she give
this handkerchief to you?

06:04.560 --> 06:05.600
You didn't steal

06:06.430 --> 06:07.800
the handkerchief, did you?

06:10.800 --> 06:11.720
It's getting late.

06:12.192 --> 06:14.400
Go prepare for the Jiuxiao
Lantern Festival in a few days.

06:14.410 --> 06:15.990
There must not be the slightest mistake.

06:16.070 --> 06:16.870
Understood.

06:16.912 --> 06:18.640
You should also rest early,
Your Highness.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.160
What a child.

06:31.180 --> 06:32.100
(Qingfeng House)

06:32.120 --> 06:33.168
Sir, come on in.

06:33.170 --> 06:34.170
- Xihe.
- Inside, please.

06:34.190 --> 06:36.190
The shad soup
in this restaurant is delicious.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.190
I especially told them
to save a large one.

06:38.190 --> 06:38.750
Later on,

06:38.912 --> 06:40.070
let's have drinks together.

06:40.592 --> 06:42.736
Why are you playing
the attentive host so much today?

06:44.480 --> 06:46.240
It's all because you

06:46.240 --> 06:47.936
are about to marry
the Crown Prince soon.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.480
My heart is broken and grieved.

06:49.630 --> 06:51.480
I was thinking
that before you enter the palace,

06:51.480 --> 06:53.040
every extra day I can spend with you

06:53.040 --> 06:54.270
is a day to cherish.

06:54.270 --> 06:55.510
You don't need to be heartbroken.

06:55.800 --> 06:58.360
Without me, you can always
go find Vice Minitser Cui.

06:59.870 --> 07:01.800
I don't even need to
marry Princess Anling anymore.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.264
Why should I keep looking for him?

07:03.720 --> 07:04.870
Well, I feel

07:05.190 --> 07:06.870
that in the way he looks at you,

07:06.870 --> 07:08.240
there is a great deal of affection.

07:09.830 --> 07:10.800
What do you mean by that?

07:10.800 --> 07:11.630
Don't scare me.

07:13.510 --> 07:15.310
Although he acts disgusted verbally,

07:16.000 --> 07:18.160
he often appears
by your side on purpose.

07:18.480 --> 07:19.630
Can't you feel it at all?

07:21.870 --> 07:24.070
Usually, it's me pestering him,

07:24.070 --> 07:26.250
and he wishes nothing more
than to stay far away from me.

07:31.270 --> 07:32.160
Vice Minitser Cui.

07:34.390 --> 07:34.950
Your Highness.

07:35.510 --> 07:36.120
Young Master Bu.

07:37.872 --> 07:39.070
I'm suddenly not hungry anymore.

07:39.070 --> 07:41.568
Let's go look around
and come back to eat later. Let's go.

07:50.430 --> 07:52.270
(Imperial Guard)
Get me a roast goose tonight.

07:52.270 --> 07:52.720
Yes, sir.

07:59.888 --> 08:00.830
I forgot the case files.

08:00.830 --> 08:01.270
Captain,

08:01.696 --> 08:03.270
which case files are you talking about?

08:03.270 --> 08:04.040
We brought them all.

08:04.040 --> 08:04.680
Shut up.

08:06.980 --> 08:09.820
(Imperial Guard)

08:20.176 --> 08:20.830
Stop right there.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.720
Why have you been avoiding me lately?

08:27.040 --> 08:27.830
Vice Minitser Cui,

08:27.830 --> 08:29.920
my superior is waiting
for me to report on the case.

08:30.750 --> 08:31.310
Excuse me.

08:44.240 --> 08:44.910
Captain Bu.

08:50.550 --> 08:50.960
Wait,

08:51.510 --> 08:52.600
what is wrong with you?

08:52.624 --> 08:54.080
Curfew is about to start in the palace.

08:54.096 --> 08:55.560
What are you still standing here for?

08:55.670 --> 08:56.670
I just wanted to ask you

08:57.440 --> 08:58.600
why you are avoiding me.

08:58.816 --> 09:00.320
My pestering you every day in the past

09:00.330 --> 09:01.630
was making trouble out of nothing.

09:01.648 --> 09:02.360
But rest assured,

09:02.390 --> 09:04.400
from now on,
even if I run into you on the street,

09:04.550 --> 09:05.960
I will treat you like a stranger.

09:10.030 --> 09:11.750
I was wrong before, alright?

09:12.150 --> 09:13.340
Please don't take it to heart.

09:13.392 --> 09:15.150
From now on,
I'll watch my words and actions

09:15.168 --> 09:16.460
and draw a clear line between us.

09:18.030 --> 09:18.720
Cut ties.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.480
Yes, cut ties.

09:19.744 --> 09:21.080
You pester me whenever you want,

09:21.080 --> 09:22.592
and cut ties whenever you please.

09:24.720 --> 09:26.150
Why are you so willful?

09:26.480 --> 09:27.030
Fine.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.960
Let's make things clear today.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.200
I won't pester you anymore,

09:30.200 --> 09:31.472
and you don't pester me either.

09:49.824 --> 09:51.790
Young Master Bu still
refuses to acknowledge you?

09:55.510 --> 09:56.870
Did you say something hurtful?

10:02.270 --> 10:04.120
Tomorrow
is the Jiuxiao Lantern Festival.

10:04.120 --> 10:06.290
After the festival,
I'll marry Commandery Princess.

10:06.360 --> 10:08.200
Don't wear
that half-dead look on your face.

10:08.480 --> 10:09.600
You should look full of joy.

10:12.840 --> 10:14.080
He wants to cut ties with me

10:14.832 --> 10:16.320
and told me not to look for him again.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.120
Is that why

10:20.600 --> 10:21.750
you've been so unhappy?

10:22.360 --> 10:23.960
I just find it baffling.

10:25.136 --> 10:26.510
In the past, when he pestered me,

10:26.790 --> 10:27.720
I was utterly annoyed.

10:27.952 --> 10:29.480
But now that he suddenly walks away,

10:30.790 --> 10:32.320
I actually feel suffocated with anger.

10:33.550 --> 10:34.480
I'm angry at myself

10:35.910 --> 10:37.480
for caring about him this much.

10:43.240 --> 10:44.750
You must have lost your heart to him.

10:46.592 --> 10:47.250
Your Highness...

10:47.440 --> 10:48.190
You didn't mishear.

10:48.820 --> 10:50.780
Precisely because
you've lost your heart to him,

10:50.790 --> 10:51.600
you feel this way.

10:54.144 --> 10:55.510
Please don't joke, Your Highness.

10:55.510 --> 10:55.910
He...

10:56.320 --> 10:57.360
He is a young man.

10:57.360 --> 10:58.550
What if she isn't a man?

10:59.600 --> 11:01.520
Young Master Bu came
to the capital as a child.

11:01.536 --> 11:02.470
So many people know him.

11:02.480 --> 11:02.870
How...

11:04.480 --> 11:04.870
How...

11:06.200 --> 11:06.870
How could this

11:07.360 --> 11:08.440
be possible?

11:11.600 --> 11:12.480
I've said enough.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.440
If you want to know the answer,

11:15.030 --> 11:16.000
find a way yourself.

11:23.740 --> 11:32.820
(Jiuxiao Lantern Festival)

11:42.030 --> 11:43.150
How incredible!

12:06.000 --> 12:06.790
Cloud Moon Cake,

12:08.120 --> 12:08.870
Plum Shadow Curd,

12:09.550 --> 12:10.360
and Snow Milk Balls.

12:11.050 --> 12:12.910
These are all
festive snacks for the festival.

12:14.120 --> 12:14.630
Try them.

12:18.690 --> 12:19.670
Thank you, Your Highness.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.630
Usually,

12:22.720 --> 12:24.390
I see you eat with great restraint.

12:24.432 --> 12:25.930
No matter how much you like something,

12:26.030 --> 12:27.550
you stop after just a few bites.

12:28.630 --> 12:29.990
When you eat with me in the future,

12:30.032 --> 12:31.500
there is no need to be so particular.

12:31.670 --> 12:33.510
Eat as much as you want.

12:58.550 --> 12:59.600
A jade hairpin

13:01.150 --> 13:02.680
signifies a proposal to a primary wife.

13:04.750 --> 13:07.200
As the wind blows, the flowers bloom.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.030
Just like my heart for you,

13:09.360 --> 13:11.696
they are the wind and flowers
that never miss their time.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.080
No matter how the years go by,

13:14.790 --> 13:15.790
I will never fail you.

13:15.790 --> 13:18.030
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

13:19.360 --> 13:21.610
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

13:22.930 --> 13:28.210
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

13:30.140 --> 13:33.080
♪I've hidden so many words♪

13:33.700 --> 13:36.500
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

13:37.370 --> 13:44.340
♪So never uncover♪

13:44.530 --> 13:46.890
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

13:48.020 --> 13:50.750
♪The flower
that withers after one bloom♪

13:51.710 --> 13:57.050
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

13:58.810 --> 14:01.630
♪Every answer I gave♪

14:02.430 --> 14:05.280
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

14:06.070 --> 14:09.440
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

14:09.700 --> 14:13.010
♪How hard it truly was?♪

14:13.510 --> 14:14.510
Xihe,

14:15.630 --> 14:16.960
for as long as I can remember,

14:18.630 --> 14:19.510
my heart

14:20.720 --> 14:22.200
has never been this joyful.

14:24.010 --> 14:29.770
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

14:30.670 --> 14:32.510
I will strive to be a good wife to you,

14:33.750 --> 14:34.870
and a good Crown Princess.

14:34.870 --> 14:36.560
♪Give you a moon in return♪

14:36.580 --> 14:37.870
But toward Your Highness,

14:38.030 --> 14:39.600
I still have no romantic feelings.

14:40.960 --> 14:41.720
I know

14:41.960 --> 14:44.320
that saying this now
might seem like a mood killer,

14:45.000 --> 14:47.270
but I prefer to make everything clear.

14:49.060 --> 14:51.820
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

14:52.360 --> 14:53.870
I have always liked your honesty.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.960
You only need to remember our agreement.

14:59.510 --> 15:00.510
If one day

15:01.790 --> 15:02.840
you fall for me,

15:03.700 --> 15:04.790
you must tell me right away.

15:07.010 --> 15:16.480
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

15:27.000 --> 15:27.660
Look over there.

15:45.600 --> 15:48.270
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

15:49.630 --> 15:52.340
♪Alone for several autumns♪

15:53.730 --> 15:56.180
♪How to choose the one♪

15:56.560 --> 16:00.120
♪To be with forever?♪

16:01.200 --> 16:04.490
♪When I gaze upon you♪

16:05.120 --> 16:08.460
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

16:09.060 --> 16:10.520
♪Gracefully♪

16:11.230 --> 16:16.290
♪For all eternity♪

16:16.730 --> 16:19.380
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

16:19.960 --> 16:23.570
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

16:24.740 --> 16:27.480
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

16:27.940 --> 16:31.780
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

16:33.910 --> 16:35.270
Did Your Highness paint

16:35.720 --> 16:37.910
the painting on
the lantern shade yourself?

16:39.390 --> 16:39.870
Yes.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.630
It depicts you and me

16:43.670 --> 16:44.510
and...

16:46.550 --> 16:47.870
what our child would look like.

16:49.830 --> 16:53.450
♪I once said all
my goodbyes in a past life♪

16:53.550 --> 16:54.720
My promise to you

16:55.328 --> 16:56.960
is made with the whole world as witness.

16:57.870 --> 17:01.870
♪I will hold you in this lifetime
until the very end♪

17:01.910 --> 17:02.960
My heart for you

17:04.110 --> 17:05.030
will never change.

17:08.260 --> 17:15.910
♪And a pool of me♪

17:44.920 --> 17:45.510
Xihe,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.000
sleep well tonight.

18:05.510 --> 18:06.350
Let's go.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.790
Tian Yuan,
go protect the Commandery Princess.

18:23.584 --> 18:24.440
Commandery Princess.

18:24.672 --> 18:26.000
Go protect the Crown Prince now.

18:26.010 --> 18:27.470
His Highness ordered me to protect you.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.200
Go now!

18:28.528 --> 18:30.400
We must not let you
come to the slightest harm.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.990
Forgive me,
but I cannot leave your side.

18:38.580 --> 18:40.440
Commandery Princess,
you can't go over there.

18:54.360 --> 18:55.350
It's too dangerous here.

18:55.350 --> 18:56.944
Please go back now, Commandery Princess.

20:03.750 --> 20:05.680
The person who just
passed by was Princess Ding,

20:06.160 --> 20:06.960
Li Yanhui?

20:08.016 --> 20:10.350
Princess Ding was the princess
of the former Nanzhou State.

20:10.790 --> 20:13.240
Are there still subordinates
loyal to her by her side?

20:15.070 --> 20:16.160
Since Nanzhou surrendered,

20:16.272 --> 20:18.110
its people have become
citizens of our Daxing.

20:19.550 --> 20:20.790
However, there are some people

20:20.900 --> 20:22.310
who only take orders from Li Yanhui.

20:23.550 --> 20:25.590
Does Your Highness think
this assassination attempt

20:25.590 --> 20:26.960
is related to Princess Ding?

20:28.640 --> 20:30.920
Today is the national
memorial day of Nanzhou.

20:31.344 --> 20:32.960
Li Yanhui went out
with her face covered,

20:33.300 --> 20:35.510
likely to quietly pay respects
to her former homeland.

20:38.580 --> 20:43.620
(Clarity and Serenity)

20:55.440 --> 20:56.030
Your Highness,

20:56.400 --> 20:57.400
during the search,

20:57.410 --> 21:00.190
the Palace Guard found Prince Ding's
Consort, Li Yanhui, by the river.

21:00.640 --> 21:02.720
They asked why
she was there late at night,

21:03.000 --> 21:03.990
but she remained silent.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.920
Just as they were in a bind,

21:06.160 --> 21:07.640
Prince Ding arrived to vouch for her

21:07.808 --> 21:09.110
and insisted on taking her away.

21:09.488 --> 21:11.400
The riverside is a place
for memorial rituals.

21:12.144 --> 21:14.224
It seems your suspicion
was correct, Your Highness.

21:14.680 --> 21:16.270
Li Yanhui traveled masked at night

21:16.300 --> 21:17.830
to pay tribute to her former homeland.

21:21.400 --> 21:21.920
Oh,

21:22.590 --> 21:24.110
she was bundled up tonight.

21:24.310 --> 21:25.590
How did you determine right away

21:25.790 --> 21:26.880
that she was Li Yanhui?

21:27.510 --> 21:29.640
The scent I noticed on Li Yanhui

21:30.160 --> 21:32.790
is identical
to the incense Prince Ding uses.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.000
But you have only met them

21:38.110 --> 21:39.110
once.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.240
Once is enough.

21:44.830 --> 21:46.920
Even with the same ingredients,
if the ratio differs,

21:47.270 --> 21:48.400
I can still detect it.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.270
Last time, at Prince Ding's manor,

21:51.920 --> 21:53.480
I noticed the incense Prince Ding used

21:53.480 --> 21:54.920
was "Four Rejections Incense".

21:55.350 --> 21:57.400
That is usually favored by poor scholars

21:57.410 --> 21:59.240
to show their elegant
contentment with poverty.

21:59.240 --> 22:00.200
The scent is faint.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.310
Yet Prince Ding

22:02.400 --> 22:04.880
carefully blended top-tier ingredients.

22:05.550 --> 22:07.510
This formula must be his own creation.

22:07.600 --> 22:08.720
I could not have mistaken it.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.750
Your sense of smell is extraordinary.

22:13.600 --> 22:14.550
You are uniquely gifted.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.830
Your Highness, what is wrong?

22:42.680 --> 22:43.830
I never understood

22:43.830 --> 22:46.440
how Commandery Princess
saw through my disguise so quickly.

22:47.480 --> 22:48.440
I wanted to know,

22:49.110 --> 22:51.160
if someone impersonates an official,

22:51.480 --> 22:52.680
what would the punishment be?

22:54.400 --> 22:55.310
Now,

22:56.750 --> 22:58.000
I finally understand.

23:03.640 --> 23:06.240
Every time before
I disguised myself to see her,

23:07.000 --> 23:08.000
I would take a pill

23:08.000 --> 23:09.790
containing Tagara Incense

23:10.240 --> 23:11.510
to alter my voice.

23:14.030 --> 23:16.110
She recognized it based on the scent

23:16.830 --> 23:17.880
of Tagara Incense.

23:18.590 --> 23:19.550
The scent is very faint.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.720
Normal people cannot detect it.

23:21.720 --> 23:22.990
But the Commandery Princess can.

23:24.350 --> 23:26.200
The ratio of this Tagara Incense formula

23:26.750 --> 23:28.280
was custom-blended for me by the abbot

23:28.680 --> 23:30.270
when I was at the Taoist temple.

23:30.350 --> 23:31.350
It is the only one.

23:32.110 --> 23:33.000
Normally,

23:33.590 --> 23:35.110
I wear Father's sachet,

23:35.264 --> 23:36.720
which has a very strong herbal scent.

23:37.070 --> 23:39.110
So it masked
the lingering scent of Tagara Incense,

23:39.280 --> 23:40.790
preventing her from recognizing me.

23:41.200 --> 23:41.780
Your Highness,

23:43.344 --> 23:45.472
among those gifts you sent
to the Commandery Princess,

23:45.920 --> 23:46.750
one of them

23:47.270 --> 23:48.830
is a pair of Tagara Incense bracelets.

23:52.100 --> 23:53.200
She has not seen them yet.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.310
If she sees it,

23:56.510 --> 23:58.880
she will know that I am the one
with the Tagara incense.

23:59.640 --> 24:01.830
She will also understand
my strategy in court,

24:01.830 --> 24:02.790
and she will understand

24:04.960 --> 24:06.650
that I am not the man she thinks I am,

24:07.240 --> 24:09.070
a Crown Prince with no backing.

24:10.220 --> 24:10.790
Your Highness.

24:11.510 --> 24:12.128
Your Highness.

24:14.400 --> 24:14.960
Your Highness.

24:17.200 --> 24:18.960
Quick! Summon
the Chief Imperial Physician!

24:19.790 --> 24:20.350
Your Highness.

24:21.030 --> 24:21.680
Your Highness!

24:25.248 --> 24:26.880
Crown Prince's cold toxin is flaring up.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.910
Prepare the medicinal bath.

24:27.920 --> 24:28.850
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

24:28.896 --> 24:30.350
Quick. Move faster, everyone.

24:44.080 --> 24:46.160
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.030
Rise.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.240
How is the Crown Prince?

24:53.350 --> 24:54.350
Replying to Your Majesty,

24:54.680 --> 24:55.880
the toxin in his body

24:56.030 --> 24:58.000
is already hardest
to suppress in winter.

24:58.590 --> 25:00.550
Today, a sudden surge
of severe anxiety and anger

25:00.550 --> 25:02.160
caused the toxin
to spiral out of control.

25:03.270 --> 25:04.110
Tian Yuan,

25:04.120 --> 25:06.990
why did the Crown Prince suffer such
a sudden surge of anxiety and anger?

25:09.960 --> 25:11.070
I do not know either.

25:11.456 --> 25:12.464
It is my incompetence

25:12.500 --> 25:14.560
for failing to take
proper care of Crown Prince.

25:14.576 --> 25:15.920
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.070
Your Majesty,

25:17.320 --> 25:18.928
the Crown Prince needs a medicinal bath,

25:18.944 --> 25:20.730
followed by acupuncture
to clear his acupoints,

25:20.740 --> 25:22.500
before his condition
can be temporarily eased.

25:22.512 --> 25:23.232
Only...

25:23.750 --> 25:24.680
Only what?

25:25.160 --> 25:26.400
The risk is very high.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.400
A single mistake

25:27.680 --> 25:28.510
could lead to...

25:30.590 --> 25:33.310
I have only
a 30 percent chance of success.

25:33.310 --> 25:34.240
Thirty percent?

25:38.110 --> 25:40.070
Is there really no other way?

25:40.360 --> 25:42.150
The poison flared up
too violently this time.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.620
If we don't administer
acupuncture immediately,

25:43.632 --> 25:44.528
I'm afraid he might...

25:46.880 --> 25:47.640
Your Majesty,

25:47.960 --> 25:49.000
let them treat him.

25:49.550 --> 25:50.480
At a time like this,

25:50.480 --> 25:52.350
we can't afford to hesitate anymore.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.480
Any further delay,

25:53.480 --> 25:55.830
and I'm afraid Huayong
will be in grave danger.

25:57.510 --> 25:58.960
What are you still standing there for?

25:58.960 --> 25:59.936
Go treat him now.

25:59.968 --> 26:01.728
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

26:12.110 --> 26:13.070
Xihe,

26:13.510 --> 26:15.200
given Huayong's current condition,

26:15.440 --> 26:16.160
are you

26:16.270 --> 26:19.110
still willing to marry
into the East Palace?

26:22.440 --> 26:24.510
Your father entrusted you to us.

26:24.640 --> 26:26.720
If you want to back out now,

26:28.400 --> 26:30.240
we would never blame you.

26:34.310 --> 26:35.000
Your Majesty,

26:35.888 --> 26:36.864
Grand Empress Dowager,

26:38.750 --> 26:41.110
husband and wife are one,
for better or worse.

26:42.510 --> 26:44.550
If I were the one lying
on the sickbed right now,

26:45.000 --> 26:47.440
I wouldn't want
my husband to abandon me either.

26:49.400 --> 26:51.920
The Crown Prince
and I share a bond of hearts.

26:52.270 --> 26:53.270
My mind is made up.

26:56.790 --> 26:58.440
To have such character and grace,

26:59.400 --> 27:01.440
you are worthy of
being the Crown Princess.

27:05.590 --> 27:07.350
I shall take my leave.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.680
Youyou...

27:16.880 --> 27:17.510
I'm here.

27:17.792 --> 27:18.790
What did you want to say?

27:25.590 --> 27:26.790
Why are your hands so cold?

27:30.110 --> 27:31.830
Go build up the charcoal fire.

27:32.240 --> 27:33.200
Move it closer.

27:33.200 --> 27:33.510
Yes.

27:33.510 --> 27:34.680
And bring another blanket.

27:34.750 --> 27:35.270
Yes.

27:57.070 --> 27:58.510
How can they still be this cold?

28:08.830 --> 28:09.880
All of you may leave us.

28:10.350 --> 28:11.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.000
Youyou...

28:30.830 --> 28:31.510
I'm here.

28:35.590 --> 28:36.550
Youyou,

28:37.680 --> 28:39.550
there are things I want to tell you.

28:39.550 --> 28:40.750
You don't need to say anything.

28:41.160 --> 28:42.440
Just focus on getting better.

29:25.310 --> 29:27.440
Your Majesties,

29:27.590 --> 29:28.590
after the acupuncture,

29:28.592 --> 29:30.980
the toxin inside the Crown Prince's
body has been suppressed.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.310
Once he wakes up,

29:32.400 --> 29:33.400
he will be out of danger.

29:34.030 --> 29:35.160
Wonderful.

29:36.720 --> 29:38.110
I will be waiting outside the hall.

29:43.310 --> 29:44.070
Zhaoning,

29:44.790 --> 29:47.720
you've been looking after
Huayong day and night without rest.

29:47.720 --> 29:48.830
It's been hard on you.

29:50.030 --> 29:51.350
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

29:51.920 --> 29:54.550
now you can finally
put your mind at ease.

29:55.110 --> 29:56.590
Go back and get some rest early.

29:57.720 --> 30:00.270
Thank you for your concern,
Your Majesties.

30:00.590 --> 30:03.000
I will come to visit
the Crown Prince again tomorrow.

30:12.510 --> 30:14.110
If you keep pushing yourself

30:14.240 --> 30:15.480
and fall ill as well,

30:15.590 --> 30:16.880
what are we to do then?

30:17.830 --> 30:20.440
The Crown Prince's
cold toxin has been suppressed.

30:20.512 --> 30:22.390
We don't need to stay up
keeping watch anymore.

30:22.750 --> 30:24.240
The bed has already been scented.

30:24.400 --> 30:26.030
Please go and get a good night's sleep.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.110
I'm not tired yet.

30:28.680 --> 30:30.160
There's one thing

30:30.270 --> 30:31.632
I haven't been able to figure out.

30:32.590 --> 30:33.990
Right after I left the East Palace,

30:34.100 --> 30:35.440
the Crown Prince had his relapse.

30:36.510 --> 30:38.030
When His Majesty asked about it,

30:38.310 --> 30:39.590
Tian Yuan cast a glance at me.

30:40.550 --> 30:41.720
Could it be

30:43.110 --> 30:45.310
that Crown Prince's
sudden surge of anxiety and anger

30:45.310 --> 30:46.790
actually had something to do with me?

30:46.920 --> 30:48.070
And these past few days,

30:48.640 --> 30:49.920
whenever Tian Yuan sees me,

30:50.030 --> 30:51.160
he acts so strangely.

30:51.830 --> 30:54.160
The Crown Prince's
health has always fluctuated.

30:54.768 --> 30:56.560
Please don't worry too much,
Your Highness.

31:06.030 --> 31:06.680
Your Highness,

31:06.784 --> 31:07.790
the Grand Minister of Rites

31:07.790 --> 31:09.890
has arrived with
the imperial decree for your marriage.

31:10.640 --> 31:13.830
By the grace of Heaven,
a union is ordained.

31:14.030 --> 31:17.590
The Crown Prince is of
noble character and supreme virtue.

31:18.070 --> 31:20.830
As he has come of age,
the East Palace needs a mistress.

31:21.160 --> 31:24.270
Shen Xihe, the eldest daughter
of Duke of Wei, Shen Yueshan,

31:24.270 --> 31:26.750
comes from an illustrious family
and possesses all four virtues.

31:26.750 --> 31:28.750
She is hereby betrothed
to the Crown Prince.

31:28.960 --> 31:30.310
By Imperial Order.

31:32.030 --> 31:32.960
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:35.440 --> 31:36.400
I accept the decree.

31:44.590 --> 31:45.960
Congratulations, Your Highness.

31:46.720 --> 31:48.400
I must return to the palace to report.

31:48.410 --> 31:50.400
I'll visit another day
to offer my congratulations.

31:50.560 --> 31:52.384
Thank you for your trouble,
Minister Zhang.

31:52.750 --> 31:54.070
Mo Yu, see our guest out.

32:03.560 --> 32:05.680
These are the betrothal gifts
from the Crown Prince.

32:05.680 --> 32:07.520
Would you like to examine them,
Your Highness?

32:09.030 --> 32:09.830
Bring them all in.

32:10.944 --> 32:11.728
Yes, Your Highness.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.110
Your Highness,

32:21.720 --> 32:22.720
you're finally awake.

32:31.808 --> 32:33.480
Have you gotten back
the pair of bracelets

32:33.568 --> 32:34.928
I gave the Commandery Princess

32:35.510 --> 32:36.590
as her betrothal gift?

32:37.960 --> 32:38.920
It is already too late.

32:39.200 --> 32:39.960
What do you mean?

32:40.880 --> 32:41.680
Commandery Princess,

32:41.680 --> 32:43.160
there are 20 pieces of jade here.

32:43.160 --> 32:44.310
I only brought a few chests

32:44.310 --> 32:45.400
for you to look at first.

32:45.400 --> 32:47.000
The rest are stored in the warehouse.

32:52.912 --> 32:55.790
There are also 50 kg of gold and
10,000 taels of silver in the warehouse.

32:57.264 --> 32:58.440
Look at this, Your Highness.

32:58.608 --> 33:01.136
This is a golden dangling hairpin
adorned with twin blossoms.

33:02.030 --> 33:02.880
And this one,

33:03.350 --> 33:05.550
a gold-threaded butterfly
hairpin with a dangling pearl.

33:06.720 --> 33:07.960
How exquisite.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.400
Lately,

33:10.624 --> 33:12.080
I tried everything I could,

33:12.144 --> 33:14.950
but those betrothal gifts had already
been registered the inventory.

33:14.960 --> 33:17.152
No one could touch them
without His Majesty's decree.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.680
And early this morning,

33:18.848 --> 33:20.720
they were delivered to
the Duke of Wei's Manor.

33:22.310 --> 33:23.270
There is also this,

33:23.480 --> 33:25.550
a dragon-and-phoenix auspicious platter.

33:25.952 --> 33:28.608
You can use it when you have
pastries in the future, Your Highness.

33:28.790 --> 33:31.000
The Crown Prince sent so many gifts,

33:31.440 --> 33:33.590
and each one was
chosen with the utmost care.

33:55.070 --> 33:56.200
Tagara Incense?

33:58.110 --> 33:59.880
What did you say, Your Highness?

34:01.240 --> 34:02.480
My name is Hua Fuhai.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.030
I came today

34:04.440 --> 34:07.720
hoping to request the return
of the Immortal Vine, Your Highness.

34:08.256 --> 34:09.984
The Embroidered Envoys
are handling a case.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.880
Anyone who dares to interfere

34:12.590 --> 34:13.840
will be executed without mercy.

34:14.656 --> 34:16.928
I'm Vice Minister Cui
of the Court of Judicial Review.

34:17.216 --> 34:19.190
I have been waiting here for you,
Your Highness,

34:19.504 --> 34:21.824
to investigate the case of
the escaped slave, Ling Long.

34:22.550 --> 34:23.920
In this world,

34:24.070 --> 34:26.944
the richest, the best fighters,
and those with the brightest futures

34:26.976 --> 34:29.230
all take orders from
the owner of this Tagara Incense.

34:29.590 --> 34:30.880
I am quite different.

34:31.180 --> 34:33.800
I have stayed away from the court
for years and am all by myself.

34:34.230 --> 34:36.960
I am just a frail, unnoticed,

34:37.670 --> 34:39.190
and idle Crown Prince.

34:39.760 --> 34:41.920
He managed to silently
infiltrate the Emperor's

34:42.480 --> 34:44.800
most disciplined and secretive forces,

34:44.870 --> 34:47.760
and he can even stand as an enemy
against Xiao Changqing and his brother.

34:48.230 --> 34:50.670
This person is unpredictable.

34:58.760 --> 34:59.760
All of you may leave now.

35:00.032 --> 35:01.320
I want to be alone for a while.

35:25.220 --> 35:30.700
(East Palace)

35:52.030 --> 35:53.880
The Tagara Incense blend
on this bracelet

35:54.440 --> 35:55.400
is unique.

35:55.840 --> 35:57.630
I have only ever
smelled it on one person.

35:59.510 --> 36:00.360
So, it turns out

36:01.670 --> 36:03.280
you are that Tagara Incense.

36:05.670 --> 36:06.440
Youyou,

36:07.230 --> 36:08.280
let me explain.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.710
I am all ears.

36:24.688 --> 36:26.320
When I was gathering the Immortal Vine,

36:28.440 --> 36:29.550
I happened to save you.

36:31.710 --> 36:33.000
That was our first meeting,

36:33.888 --> 36:35.360
and there was no calculation involved.

36:37.312 --> 36:39.190
Seeing your cold
detachment toward Prince Lie,

36:40.960 --> 36:41.960
I was surprised.

36:42.896 --> 36:45.400
The wisdom and composure you showed
when taking the Rouge Ledger

36:47.440 --> 36:48.440
made me curious.

36:50.110 --> 36:51.880
The way you saw
through my disguised identity

36:52.800 --> 36:53.840
earned my admiration

36:54.670 --> 36:55.800
and won my heart even more.

36:56.176 --> 36:58.240
When the poison flared up
and I almost lost my life,

36:58.570 --> 37:00.070
it was you who gave the Immortal Vine

37:00.480 --> 37:02.800
without a second thought
to a stranger like me.

37:08.800 --> 37:09.920
Before I knew it,

37:11.030 --> 37:12.360
I had already fallen too deep.

37:14.710 --> 37:17.110
Later, when I found out
I only had five years left to live,

37:19.488 --> 37:21.712
I did think about giving up
on this relationship.

37:22.280 --> 37:23.840
But when I saw you fall off the cliff,

37:24.880 --> 37:25.840
I suddenly realized

37:28.230 --> 37:30.790
that I had already reached
a point where I couldn't let you go.

37:34.630 --> 37:35.920
So, during that period of time,

37:35.968 --> 37:37.616
you told me you
were leaving the capital,

37:37.920 --> 37:39.670
but you actually went to the snowy peaks

37:39.744 --> 37:41.440
to search for
the Extreme Frost Cordyceps.

37:42.384 --> 37:43.550
And it was because of this

37:44.440 --> 37:46.630
that the poison
blinded your eyes to colors.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.320
Yes.

37:50.128 --> 37:52.080
You play the part
of a frail Crown Prince,

37:52.510 --> 37:53.630
yet you have been quietly

37:54.550 --> 37:55.710
recruiting forces

37:56.150 --> 37:57.400
and laying your trap in court,

37:57.952 --> 37:59.840
all just to find
the person who poisoned you.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.710
That person is hidden so deeply

38:03.220 --> 38:04.920
that even now,
there is not a single clue.

38:05.700 --> 38:07.510
That is why I never
made things clear to you.

38:12.496 --> 38:15.070
Thank you for coming to my aid
time and again, Your Highness.

38:16.190 --> 38:18.840
I will do everything I can to repay you.

38:20.070 --> 38:21.760
But I ask Your Highness to cooperate

38:21.888 --> 38:23.150
and break off our engagement.

38:29.070 --> 38:30.030
What did you say?

38:30.512 --> 38:32.576
Not only did you infiltrate
the Embroidered Envoys,

38:33.280 --> 38:35.440
but you can also command
the wealthy Hua Fuhai.

38:36.320 --> 38:37.360
Even Cui Jinbai,

38:37.480 --> 38:40.280
the young and powerful minister
His Majesty trusts most,

38:40.550 --> 38:41.710
is actually your subordinate.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.630
You have never been

38:43.630 --> 38:45.584
some innocent, harmless,
and weak Crown Prince.

38:46.030 --> 38:47.520
If we turn against each other one day,

38:47.600 --> 38:48.710
and I take a single misstep,

38:49.190 --> 38:50.670
I will be utterly destroyed,

38:50.670 --> 38:53.150
and it would even drag the Shen family
into eternal damnation.

38:55.830 --> 38:57.920
If I had looked at
the betrothal gift list earlier,

38:58.176 --> 39:00.304
there wouldn't have
been a marriage decree at all.

39:03.880 --> 39:05.360
You weighed the pros and cons

39:07.070 --> 39:08.280
and considered everything,

39:10.400 --> 39:12.070
yet you failed to consider me.

39:12.400 --> 39:14.760
In the end, you never believed
in my true feelings for you.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.000
What do true feelings matter?

39:16.960 --> 39:18.070
How many true feelings

39:18.630 --> 39:21.000
change in an instant
when faced with conflicts of power?

39:22.176 --> 39:24.150
I cannot do this at the expense
of my loved ones,

39:24.630 --> 39:26.030
nor can I risk everything

39:26.320 --> 39:28.630
to gamble on a heart
staying true forever.

39:49.700 --> 39:53.100
(Sea Within the Heart)

39:56.550 --> 39:58.710
Before the Grand Historian
sets the wedding date,

39:59.296 --> 40:01.230
please think it over carefully,
Your Highness.

40:15.440 --> 40:21.150
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

40:22.590 --> 40:25.270
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom
is more than wind and sand♪

40:25.590 --> 40:26.670
I will never allow you,

40:28.190 --> 40:29.670
while I am still alive,

40:30.800 --> 40:31.840
to marry anyone else.

40:32.860 --> 40:35.040
♪Hides in the clamor♪

40:35.070 --> 40:37.480
Any man of the imperial family
is mine to choose.

40:38.440 --> 40:40.000
Even in front of His Majesty,

40:40.630 --> 40:42.000
I would dare to say these words.

40:43.490 --> 40:49.020
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

40:49.420 --> 40:56.200
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

40:56.230 --> 40:57.984
It doesn't matter what choice you make.

40:59.510 --> 41:00.360
In the end,

41:02.630 --> 41:03.840
you can only choose me.

41:04.560 --> 41:07.900
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

41:07.900 --> 41:11.490
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

41:11.490 --> 41:14.760
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

41:14.900 --> 41:18.450
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

41:18.450 --> 41:22.020
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

41:22.020 --> 41:28.470
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

41:44.920 --> 41:46.000
I will take my leave.

41:49.860 --> 41:55.650
♪A heart weathered by frost
will melt in love♪

41:56.670 --> 42:02.430
♪Across countless miles
of treasured moments♪

42:03.780 --> 42:09.570
♪With this broken body,
I'll become your armor♪

42:10.630 --> 42:16.240
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

42:16.400 --> 42:23.990
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

42:24.660 --> 42:28.200
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

42:28.200 --> 42:31.510
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

42:31.760 --> 42:35.200
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

42:35.200 --> 42:38.720
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

42:38.720 --> 42:42.220
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

42:42.220 --> 42:44.720
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

42:44.760 --> 42:45.590
Commandery Princess,

42:45.800 --> 42:47.920
how did your talk with
the Crown Prince go?

42:50.150 --> 42:51.760
I want to part with him on good terms.

42:53.880 --> 42:55.280
Right now, I only regret

42:56.112 --> 42:58.288
that I shouldn't have
provoked him in the first place.

42:58.960 --> 43:01.920
Before, I only thought
the Crown Prince was deep.

43:02.000 --> 43:03.280
Only now do I realize

43:03.280 --> 43:04.880
his abilities are so terrifying.

43:05.040 --> 43:07.150
If he holds a grudge over
you calling off the wedding

43:07.480 --> 43:08.630
and becomes our enemy,

43:08.900 --> 43:10.190
what should we do, Your Highness?

43:10.480 --> 43:11.920
If it's a fair and square battle,

43:12.320 --> 43:13.280
win or lose,

43:13.510 --> 43:14.630
I will accept the outcome.

43:16.440 --> 43:18.590
I just don't want to
deal with him hypocritically,

43:19.020 --> 43:22.180
and I don't want us to become the people
who guard against each other the most.

43:22.880 --> 43:23.710
Commandery Princess,

43:23.728 --> 43:25.880
do you really not plan
to marry into the East Palace?

43:26.000 --> 43:26.630
No, I don't.

43:29.250 --> 43:31.330
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

43:31.330 --> 43:36.900
(East Palace)

43:58.480 --> 43:59.550
Who else

44:00.000 --> 44:01.320
is a better match for you than me,

44:01.536 --> 44:03.070
who has a legitimate imperial descent

44:03.360 --> 44:04.480
and a short life expectancy?

44:06.670 --> 44:07.920
Legitimate imperial descent

44:08.440 --> 44:09.320
can be changed.

44:09.872 --> 44:11.472
Whether your life is short or not

44:11.760 --> 44:12.760
can be orchestrated.

44:14.440 --> 44:15.000
Get out.

44:20.871 --> 44:23.811
♪I've hidden so many words♪

44:24.431 --> 44:27.231
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

44:28.101 --> 44:35.071
♪So never uncover♪

44:35.261 --> 44:37.621
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:38.751 --> 44:41.481
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:42.441 --> 44:47.781
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

44:49.541 --> 44:52.361
♪Every answer I gave♪

44:53.161 --> 44:56.011
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

44:56.801 --> 45:00.171
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

45:00.431 --> 45:03.741
♪How hard it truly was?♪

45:06.711 --> 45:10.151
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

45:11.141 --> 45:13.471
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

45:14.741 --> 45:20.501
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

45:21.911 --> 45:25.041
♪It's a shame I never could♪

45:25.491 --> 45:28.501
♪Give you a moon in return♪

45:28.611 --> 45:35.251
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:35.251 --> 45:38.921
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:39.791 --> 45:42.551
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:42.991 --> 45:46.121
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:46.561 --> 45:52.511
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

45:53.911 --> 45:57.461
♪You'll never♪

45:57.741 --> 46:07.211
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:33.381 --> 46:36.861
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
